  <p class="body-text">Our Hogan Pant has been remade for the High Summer using a super soft summer twill. The fabric is made from a fine combed cotton yarn woven into a 295 GSM twill. We tried to pivot away from the normal crispness of our classic cotton twill base quality to offer our classic pant style in a beautiful fabric that is notably soft when you grab a handful of it. We used traditional dyed corozo nut buttons and embellished the back right upper pocket area with a black tonal engravers stamp logo label on all colorways.</p>
</div>

