  <p class="body-text">The Expedition Short is our relaxed fit dual rear patch pocket short. Its front pockets are angled to reference OG fatigue style bottoms. The large rear patch pockets have angled corners and are reinforced with bar tacs at the opening pressure points. Both the inseam and outseam feature dual needle chainstitching for added seam strength.</p>
